@startuml
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ11 UC11 私信与媒体分享组件顺序图
autonumber
actor "发送者" as U
actor "接收者" as V
participant "ChatPage" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "消息管理" as MSG
participant "媒体服务" as MEDIA
participant "通知管理" as NOTIFY
U -> UI: 打开会话
UI -> GW: GET /messages/conversations/{id}
GW -> MSG: listMessages(userId, conversationId)
MSG --> GW: 消息列表/权限错误
GW --> UI: 会话消息
U -> UI: 发送文本或媒体分享
UI -> GW: POST /messages
GW -> MSG: sendMessage(command)
opt 媒体分享
  MSG -> MEDIA: validateReference(video/live)
  MEDIA --> MSG: 媒体摘要/无效
end
MSG -> NOTIFY: notifyRecipient(message)
NOTIFY --> MSG: notificationCreated
MSG --> GW: messageDTO
GW --> UI: 发送结果
UI --> V: 实时/站内新消息提醒
@enduml
